      "name": "t:general.my_story",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "My Story",
        "body": "<p>It started on September 25, 2022, when I went on my first hike. Without any previous experience, I was wearing old running shoes.</p><p>There were 245 km ahead. I went from Porto to the Cathedral of Santiago, right now I'm getting a pleasant shiver as I write this.</p><p>I could not wish for a more beautiful road, no, I could not even imagine what it would bring me, where it would take me. Please, go hike yourself.</p><p>Your courage is the beginning of a new path. With love, respect and gratitude for yourself, your body.</p><p>And get comfortable shoes!</p>",
        "signature": "Gerda",
        "quote": "The journey of a\nthousand miles begins\nwith a single step.",
        "quote_size": 48,
        "quote_rotation": -12,
